WEBVTT


00:01:42.599 --> 00:01:44.040
Put it all on my tab.

00:01:45.359 --> 00:01:47.599
At the casino, you win some, you lose some.

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:48.480
If you lose today,

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:49.879
just win it back tomorrow, right?

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:52.319
Don't let a little money like this

00:01:52.319 --> 00:01:53.519
make me think less of you.

00:01:54.079 --> 00:01:55.719
Besides, this isn't thrilling enough.

00:01:57.599 --> 00:01:59.680
In a bit, I'll show you something far more exciting.

00:02:00.359 --> 00:02:00.799
Brother Biao.

00:02:02.159 --> 00:02:02.680
Did they talk?

00:02:03.439 --> 00:02:04.000
They did.

00:02:04.760 --> 00:02:06.879
Rat Qiang's men put them up to it.

00:02:08.560 --> 00:02:09.840
They sure have some nerve.

00:02:21.439 --> 00:02:22.719
Brother Biao, Brother Biao!

00:02:23.639 --> 00:02:25.879
Brother Biao, it's this punk.

00:02:26.039 --> 00:02:27.439
He brought guys and robbed our stash.

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:33.520
Didn't your parents ever teach you

00:02:33.520 --> 00:02:35.159
that taking other people's stuff is wrong?

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:39.000
Fine.

00:02:41.759 --> 00:02:43.439
Since you love taking things so much,

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:49.159
I'll give you this vial of potassium cyanide.

00:02:51.719 --> 00:02:53.080
It might not look like much,

00:02:53.879 --> 00:02:54.719
but it's more than enough

00:02:54.719 --> 00:02:56.439
to send you straight to the other side.

00:03:00.479 --> 00:03:03.120
Brother Biao, killing someone over something like this...

00:03:03.719 --> 00:03:04.240
is it really worth it?

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:05.719
I don't want to kill him either.

00:03:07.439 --> 00:03:10.039
But he keeps stealing my shipments

00:03:10.199 --> 00:03:11.240
and muscling in on my turf.

00:03:12.280 --> 00:03:13.319
How am I supposed to run things?

00:03:18.280 --> 00:03:19.240
Murder is a major crime.

00:03:19.719 --> 00:03:20.960
The cops will definitely hunt us down.

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.360
That can't be good for business, right?

00:03:25.599 --> 00:03:27.199
Why do you sound like a cop?

00:03:29.639 --> 00:03:30.879
Brother Biao, you've got me wrong.

00:03:30.879 --> 00:03:31.639
What I mean is,

00:03:31.639 --> 00:03:32.639
no matter what we do,

00:03:32.639 --> 00:03:33.919
we always need to watch our backs.

00:03:34.439 --> 00:03:35.439
So what you're saying is...

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:37.479
we should let him go?

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.639
Brother Biao, Brother Biao, I was wrong!

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:50.919
Please spare my life!

00:03:51.560 --> 00:03:53.759
I'll do whatever you tell me from now on!

00:03:53.759 --> 00:03:55.080
Brother Biao, I was wrong!

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:56.159
Spare my life!

00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:57.319
Brother Biao!

00:03:57.879 --> 00:03:58.479
Don't kill me!

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:00.960
Don't kill me!

00:04:01.439 --> 00:04:03.520
Brother Biao, have mercy and spare me!

00:04:04.159 --> 00:04:05.479
Since you're begging like this,

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.599
I won't kill you.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.159
Thank you, Brother Biao!

00:04:09.879 --> 00:04:10.319
You do it.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:17.959
Getting to work with me so soon,

00:04:18.439 --> 00:04:19.639
the boys aren't convinced.

00:04:20.120 --> 00:04:22.079
Every one of them has blood on their hands.

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:23.519
You've got to get some on yours, too.

00:04:34.279 --> 00:04:34.959
Brother!

00:04:35.519 --> 00:04:36.560
We've got no beef between us!

00:04:36.959 --> 00:04:38.040
Don't kill me, please!

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:39.160
Brother, what are you doing?

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:42.680
Brother!

00:04:42.839 --> 00:04:43.839
Brother, what are you doing?

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:45.759
Brother!

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.720
Brother, have mercy! Spare my life!

00:04:48.920 --> 00:04:49.600
Spare my life!

00:04:50.839 --> 00:04:52.600
I'm begging you, spare my life!

00:04:53.279 --> 00:04:54.800
Have mercy, don't kill me!

00:04:55.680 --> 00:04:56.720
Brother, please don't kill me!

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:00.040
I...

00:05:00.399 --> 00:05:00.959
I...

00:05:02.399 --> 00:05:03.680
Damn, you're ruthless.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:10.959
Nice.

00:05:15.839 --> 00:05:16.800
What's the meaning of this?

00:05:17.120 --> 00:05:17.639
Brother Kai.

00:05:18.240 --> 00:05:19.879
Brother Kai, it was just a joke.

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:21.000
We're all brothers here.

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:24.720
We just wanted to test your nerve.

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:25.879
Test me?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:27.240
None of you trust me, do you?

00:05:27.360 --> 00:05:28.480
Fine, Brother Biao.

00:05:29.199 --> 00:05:30.360
If you don't trust me,

00:05:30.519 --> 00:05:31.600
then find someone else.

00:05:32.519 --> 00:05:33.160
Brother Kai.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:36.920
Brother Kai, cool off for a second.

00:05:38.360 --> 00:05:41.480
Everyone has to pass this test.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:44.360
Only when we know what each other is made of

00:05:44.519 --> 00:05:45.920
can we work together with confidence.

00:05:47.839 --> 00:05:48.600
Walk away then!

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.120
Did I beg you to come?

00:05:52.360 --> 00:05:53.439
I already told you,

00:05:53.839 --> 00:05:55.199
everyone has to go through this.

00:05:55.360 --> 00:05:56.480
So what if we tested you?

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.600
Five million a year. You in or out?

00:06:19.439 --> 00:06:20.600
From now on,

00:06:21.519 --> 00:06:23.959
we're in the same boat.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:46.600
Stop.

00:06:49.199 --> 00:06:49.639
Rewind.

00:06:54.279 --> 00:06:54.920
That's the guy

00:06:55.720 --> 00:06:57.040
who walked out of the bank with Qian Feng.

00:08:10.399 --> 00:08:11.040
Elvis.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:12.600
What?

00:08:15.199 --> 00:08:16.839
Some big shots from the capital just arrived.

00:08:17.279 --> 00:08:18.000
What big shots?

00:08:18.920 --> 00:08:21.319
Mu Qing, a heavyweight in success coaching.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:22.439
Mu Qing?

00:08:24.879 --> 00:08:26.000
Doesn't ring a bell.

00:08:26.519 --> 00:08:28.040
You must've heard of William Han, right?

00:08:28.959 --> 00:08:30.439
William Han?

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:32.919
Sounds pretty westernized.

00:08:33.279 --> 00:08:34.200
Probably a fake foreigner.

00:08:36.519 --> 00:08:37.399
Let me tell you,

00:08:37.759 --> 00:08:40.559
William Han is a prominent success guru.

00:08:40.759 --> 00:08:42.120
He's even published bestselling books.

00:08:43.000 --> 00:08:43.720
Success coaching?

00:08:46.879 --> 00:08:48.720
Tell him to teach me how to succeed, then.

00:08:51.279 --> 00:08:53.039
That's why I say you lack vision.

00:08:53.759 --> 00:08:54.919
Ultimate Execution...

00:08:55.159 --> 00:08:56.080
Ever heard of that book?

00:08:56.480 --> 00:08:57.360
He's the one who wrote it.

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.759
It's something tons of young folks

00:08:59.960 --> 00:09:01.200
revere as a motivational bible.

00:09:03.480 --> 00:09:04.519
Though,

00:09:04.679 --> 00:09:06.840
I only learned this at yesterday's lecture.

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:08.639
And this Mu Qing I mentioned

00:09:08.799 --> 00:09:10.440
is the big boss behind William Han.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:11.840
I'm telling you,

00:09:12.240 --> 00:09:15.240
we're dealing with successful elites this time.

00:09:15.399 --> 00:09:17.200
I'm bringing her over to meet you.

00:09:18.840 --> 00:09:21.279
Try your best to act cultured.

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:22.759
Don't let them take one look at you

00:09:22.759 --> 00:09:23.759
and think you're some dimwit punk.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:25.320
Don't worry.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:28.720
When it comes to class,

00:09:29.600 --> 00:09:31.759
I've got it totally nailed.

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:33.519
Just tell me when you'll be here.

00:09:33.759 --> 00:09:34.360
We'll be there shortly.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:10.000
All right.

00:10:11.960 --> 00:10:13.279
Having a blast, huh?

00:10:13.279 --> 00:10:13.840
Good times!

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:14.320
Great!

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.080
Sister Xin.

00:10:18.240 --> 00:10:19.279
A customer just told me

00:10:19.279 --> 00:10:20.480
that the table outside is too loud.

00:10:20.639 --> 00:10:21.600
So I went out and told them

00:10:21.600 --> 00:10:22.480
to keep it down,

00:10:22.600 --> 00:10:23.480
but they completely ignored me.

00:10:24.360 --> 00:10:26.120
It's fine. Go take care of other things.

00:10:26.279 --> 00:10:26.919
I'll go check on them.

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:32.360
What the hell are you looking at?

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.159
Whatever.

00:10:37.840 --> 00:10:39.120
Come on, a toast to you, bro.

00:10:39.279 --> 00:10:40.480
Drink it yourself.

00:10:40.840 --> 00:10:41.799
Excuse me, gentlemen.

00:10:42.159 --> 00:10:42.960
Sorry to interrupt.

00:10:43.320 --> 00:10:45.279
Could you please keep your voices down?

00:10:45.440 --> 00:10:46.440
There are other customers nearby.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:49.000
What's your damn problem?

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:52.240
We're paying customers here!

00:10:53.759 --> 00:10:55.159
We can't even have a chat?

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:56.399
Yeah, exactly!

00:10:56.639 --> 00:10:57.720
Of course you can.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:10:59.759
Just please lower your voices a bit.

00:11:00.879 --> 00:11:02.480
Listen here, you bitch.

00:11:02.759 --> 00:11:04.080
You got a death wish?

00:11:04.480 --> 00:11:06.200
Do you have any idea who our boss is?

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:10.960
The lady boss is so gorgeous,

00:11:12.639 --> 00:11:14.080
and you two are being so rude to her.

00:11:15.519 --> 00:11:16.039
Come on.

00:11:19.879 --> 00:11:21.759
As long as she downs this drink for me,

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.399
the three of us will do whatever you say.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:26.559
Yeah, whatever you say!

00:11:27.879 --> 00:11:28.679
I'm sorry,

00:11:28.679 --> 00:11:29.759
I... I don't drink.

00:11:31.440 --> 00:11:32.440
Is that so?

00:11:32.600 --> 00:11:33.759
When I tell you to drink, you drink!

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:35.679
Cut the bullshit!

00:11:36.120 --> 00:11:36.840
Come on, have a drink!

00:11:36.840 --> 00:11:37.639
Drink!

00:11:37.799 --> 00:11:39.200
Come on, drink up!

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:39.720
Take a drink!

00:11:40.200 --> 00:11:41.240
Drink it! Drink it!

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:45.039
You fucking bitch!

00:11:46.600 --> 00:11:47.440
Who the hell are you?

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:48.519
You wanna die?

00:11:57.960 --> 00:11:58.799
I'll give you ten seconds.

00:11:59.120 --> 00:11:59.960
Get the fuck out of here.

00:12:00.639 --> 00:12:01.200
Scram!

00:12:17.480 --> 00:12:18.159
Thanks.

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:19.840
You're welcome.

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:21.799
What a coincidence.

00:12:21.799 --> 00:12:22.519
We meet again.

00:12:26.159 --> 00:12:27.279
What, don't you recognize me?

00:12:27.600 --> 00:12:28.200
You're Tian Xin.

00:12:28.200 --> 00:12:29.519
We've met before.

00:12:31.039 --> 00:12:32.639
Though I had no idea this was your café.

00:12:35.559 --> 00:12:36.240
P-Please, have a seat.

00:12:36.399 --> 00:12:37.639
I... I'll go...

00:12:37.919 --> 00:12:38.919
N-No, don't bother.

00:12:39.720 --> 00:12:41.279
I'm actually meeting someone.

00:12:46.879 --> 00:12:48.159
I wonder when

00:12:48.159 --> 00:12:49.600
we'll be able to meet again.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.840
If we do meet next time,

00:12:52.919 --> 00:12:54.720
I hope you can sit down and have a real chat with me.

00:12:57.759 --> 00:12:58.120
I'm off.

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:10.240
Sis, right here.

00:14:31.279 --> 00:14:31.799
Boss,

00:14:32.159 --> 00:14:34.320
Elvis will soon bring someone named Mu Qing

00:14:34.480 --> 00:14:35.559
to Xu Duoduo's place.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.080
They're meeting tonight,

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:38.960
most likely to discuss their next deal.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:41.000
So you must find out

00:14:41.559 --> 00:14:43.080
the exact details of that deal.

00:14:43.679 --> 00:14:44.240
Copy that.

00:15:08.559 --> 00:15:09.080
Captain Lu,

00:15:09.799 --> 00:15:10.919
should I head over there now?

00:15:12.759 --> 00:15:13.240
No need.

00:15:14.039 --> 00:15:15.120
Li Qiang hasn't even shown up yet,

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:17.559
and the deal won't happen today anyway.

00:15:18.000 --> 00:15:18.519
Go on.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:25.120
Qian Feng and Li Xia

00:15:25.600 --> 00:15:27.000
actually rarely met in person.

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:28.120
Their emotional connection

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:31.200
was mainly Qian Feng's financial aid to Li Xia.

00:15:31.679 --> 00:15:32.919
Furthermore, their neighbors

00:15:33.039 --> 00:15:34.960
knew nothing about their relationship.

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:37.080
In Li Xia's home,

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:39.639
we found no valuable leads either.

00:15:40.519 --> 00:15:42.120
Of the two women in Qian Feng's life,

00:15:42.399 --> 00:15:43.519
one refuses to talk,

00:15:43.840 --> 00:15:44.759
and the other knows nothing.

00:15:45.240 --> 00:15:46.279
Where do we take the case from here?

00:15:50.799 --> 00:15:52.480
The suspect from Baijia Alley...

00:15:53.039 --> 00:15:53.600
any news on him?

00:15:55.559 --> 00:15:57.519
Zhuang Yan and Ge Dan pulled two

00:15:57.519 --> 00:15:58.679
stills from surveillance footage.

00:15:59.440 --> 00:16:00.159
Tao'er, put them up.

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:05.159
As for these two photos,

00:16:05.159 --> 00:16:07.480
one shows his back, the other his profile.

00:16:07.720 --> 00:16:10.559
But the suspect's facial features

00:16:10.720 --> 00:16:11.799
aren't clearly visible.

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:19.720
Could we try a sketch artist?

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:21.759
See if they can use these two photos

00:16:22.039 --> 00:16:23.720
to reconstruct the suspect's face.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:27.799
Didn't Zhuang Yan successfully sketch

00:16:27.799 --> 00:16:28.639
Geng Hao's portrait last time?

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.000
Let him do it again.

00:16:30.039 --> 00:16:31.200
That was just pure luck.

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.200
Besides, there were many eyewitnesses

00:16:33.559 --> 00:16:35.519
giving details on his appearance,

00:16:35.519 --> 00:16:36.759
and I'd also seen him myself.

00:16:38.320 --> 00:16:39.240
But this time,

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:43.519
we really need a master sketch artist.

00:16:45.519 --> 00:16:47.600
Experts like that are rare in the country.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:48.559
Take Nanhai, for example.

00:16:49.080 --> 00:16:50.159
In a place like Nanhai,

00:16:50.159 --> 00:16:52.120
there's actually a master artist like that.

00:16:52.799 --> 00:16:53.879
And he's right beside me.

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:35.480
For revealing your identity from years ago,

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:37.119
you don't blame me, do you?

00:17:42.920 --> 00:17:43.359
It's fine.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:48.559
No matter what happened in the past,

00:17:49.079 --> 00:17:50.599
we should all learn to let go.

00:17:51.319 --> 00:17:52.200
Look at Zhuang Yan.

00:17:55.640 --> 00:17:56.680
Be easier on yourself,

00:17:57.920 --> 00:18:00.319
and the road ahead will be a lot lighter.

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:01.519
Right?

00:18:04.359 --> 00:18:05.160
I'll try.

00:18:08.160 --> 00:18:09.240
Wait a second, Captain Bai.

00:18:10.359 --> 00:18:12.000
Has your next target

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.440
become me now?

00:18:17.559 --> 00:18:18.240
I'll try.

00:18:32.039 --> 00:18:32.640
Where are you headed?

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.079
I'm off work, heading home.

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:39.279
Let me give you a ride.

00:18:39.799 --> 00:18:40.640
No need.

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:41.680
I can just take a cab.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:42.519
It's no trouble.

00:18:42.839 --> 00:18:44.200
It's right on my way.

00:18:50.480 --> 00:18:51.799
Miss Tian, you don't think

00:18:52.839 --> 00:18:53.759
I'm a bad guy, do you?

00:18:54.839 --> 00:18:55.759
No, not at all.

00:18:56.200 --> 00:18:57.039
Of course not.

00:18:57.759 --> 00:19:00.160
You even helped me fight off those thugs.

00:19:00.359 --> 00:19:01.039
In that case,

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:02.160
don't be shy.

00:19:02.359 --> 00:19:02.960
Come on.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:07.559
After you.

00:19:38.519 --> 00:19:39.000
Seatbelt.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:09.400
Are you feeling a bit warm,

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:11.119
Miss Tian?

00:20:12.240 --> 00:20:12.759
Wh-What?

00:20:13.559 --> 00:20:14.400
What?

00:20:15.279 --> 00:20:16.880
I asked if you were feeling a bit warm.

00:20:17.279 --> 00:20:18.480
Want me to turn on the AC?

00:20:21.599 --> 00:20:22.119
Sure.

00:20:28.079 --> 00:20:28.559
Please, come in.

00:21:08.799 --> 00:21:10.400
This is Sister Mu Qing.

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:12.599
Sister Mu Qing.

00:21:13.599 --> 00:21:14.519
Um, please take a seat.

00:21:25.559 --> 00:21:26.640
As for our product,

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:28.680
it all comes from Jiechan State,

00:21:29.559 --> 00:21:31.680
through Jiangyang to Chang'an,

00:21:31.799 --> 00:21:32.680
and finally to Nanhai.

00:21:33.039 --> 00:21:35.160
Our product is always top-grade.

00:21:52.359 --> 00:21:55.200
You're acting pretty strange, you know?

00:21:57.039 --> 00:21:57.920
Wh-What?

00:21:58.319 --> 00:21:58.720
Me?

00:22:02.319 --> 00:22:03.000
Yeah.

00:22:03.759 --> 00:22:05.640
When you first saw me,

00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:06.480
you seemed kind of nervous.

00:22:07.119 --> 00:22:08.240
Then when I told you to get in the car,

00:22:08.279 --> 00:22:09.480
you hesitated for quite a while.

00:22:10.319 --> 00:22:11.599
Now, after all this time,

00:22:12.039 --> 00:22:13.480
you haven't even asked what I do.

00:22:14.440 --> 00:22:15.519
It's like from the very start,

00:22:15.519 --> 00:22:17.039
you already knew what I do.

00:22:21.319 --> 00:22:22.039
No...

00:22:22.880 --> 00:22:23.720
I'm just...

00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:26.160
not really used to

00:22:27.079 --> 00:22:28.319
prying into other people's business.

00:22:46.799 --> 00:22:48.640
Our goods are all top grade.

00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:51.279
I'm asking who the other side is.

00:22:52.319 --> 00:22:53.680
Do you know their background?

00:22:55.240 --> 00:22:58.319
My con... contact, Brother Qiang!

00:22:58.799 --> 00:23:00.960
Brother Qiang runs the streets: ruthless and heavily stocked.

00:23:01.480 --> 00:23:02.200
Totally reliable.

00:23:02.559 --> 00:23:03.599
Definitely not cops.

00:23:04.279 --> 00:23:05.519
How can you be so sure?

00:23:07.519 --> 00:23:08.680
His men,

00:23:10.720 --> 00:23:11.559
they all snort powder.

00:23:12.000 --> 00:23:13.079
I saw it with my own eyes.

00:23:13.400 --> 00:23:14.240
Cops wouldn't dare.

00:23:21.720 --> 00:23:23.079
You're so nervous talking to me.

00:23:24.799 --> 00:23:26.359
Is it because you have a boyfriend?

00:23:29.319 --> 00:23:29.920
No, of course not.

00:23:33.960 --> 00:23:36.680
Good men are so rare these days.

00:23:37.440 --> 00:23:38.720
Where would I find a boyfriend?

00:23:40.079 --> 00:23:41.599
Then what's your standard

00:23:41.599 --> 00:23:42.720
for a good man?

00:23:44.480 --> 00:23:45.119
Actually,

00:23:47.079 --> 00:23:47.960
I don't really know.

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:49.880
Maybe...

00:23:50.720 --> 00:23:52.119
when I need someone most,

00:23:53.200 --> 00:23:54.559
just being there for me is enough.

00:23:55.160 --> 00:23:56.319
Tomorrow at 2:00 p.m.,

00:23:56.440 --> 00:23:57.680
Weisheng International Hotel,

00:23:57.680 --> 00:23:59.039
William's press conference.

00:23:59.160 --> 00:24:00.000
When the time comes,

00:24:00.279 --> 00:24:03.200
have him take the invitation and phone

00:24:03.319 --> 00:24:04.079
and enter the venue.

00:24:05.359 --> 00:24:06.920
No matter how many men they have,

00:24:07.240 --> 00:24:09.400
only one person can come do the deal.

00:24:10.759 --> 00:24:12.400
Our people will contact him.

00:24:13.440 --> 00:24:14.240
Do you understand?

00:24:15.920 --> 00:24:17.200
I understand,

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:20.160
but with so many reporters at a press conference,

00:24:20.920 --> 00:24:21.920
isn't that a bit too...

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:23.960
All the reporters' attention

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:25.240
will be on William.

00:24:25.240 --> 00:24:26.559
No one will suspect a thing.

00:24:27.039 --> 00:24:28.519
Our people will contact him

00:24:28.640 --> 00:24:30.039
and tell him how the deal goes down.

00:24:30.400 --> 00:24:31.960
He goes alone.

00:24:33.920 --> 00:24:34.599
Just one person.

00:24:35.359 --> 00:24:37.000
Then I'll have to check with my boss.

00:24:37.680 --> 00:24:38.960
Tell him to decide right now.

00:24:39.319 --> 00:24:40.200
If there's any hesitation,

00:24:40.759 --> 00:24:41.680
the deal is off.

00:24:44.319 --> 00:24:45.640
How am I supposed to say that?

00:24:48.359 --> 00:24:49.359
Just call and ask him.

00:24:55.759 --> 00:24:56.079
Okay.

00:25:05.000 --> 00:25:06.880
You saw me outside your door earlier.

00:25:07.880 --> 00:25:09.519
When we ran into each other just now,

00:25:09.759 --> 00:25:11.000
you might have wondered

00:25:11.759 --> 00:25:12.880
if it wasn't a coincidence.

00:25:14.279 --> 00:25:15.599
You might even have thought

00:25:17.279 --> 00:25:19.200
I had bad intentions toward you.

00:25:23.319 --> 00:25:24.440
No, not at all.

00:25:24.440 --> 00:25:25.319
No need to rush to deny it.

00:25:26.680 --> 00:25:27.519
Actually,

00:25:29.519 --> 00:25:31.079
the truth is, I followed you today

00:25:31.519 --> 00:25:33.039
to find your cafe.

00:25:36.240 --> 00:25:37.640
I'm telling you the truth

00:25:38.119 --> 00:25:39.200
because I want you to know

00:25:39.400 --> 00:25:40.359
I'm not a bad person.

00:25:41.559 --> 00:25:43.640
I really don't have any ulterior motives,

00:25:44.400 --> 00:25:46.240
I just wanted to chat with you

00:25:46.240 --> 00:25:47.519
and get to know each other.

00:25:48.079 --> 00:25:48.640
Really.

00:25:50.359 --> 00:25:51.240
It's as simple as that.

00:26:02.200 --> 00:26:02.920
Brother Qiang.

00:26:02.920 --> 00:26:04.599
That kid Xu Duoduo just called.

00:26:04.920 --> 00:26:06.119
Said the deal's all set up.

00:26:06.839 --> 00:26:07.359
A big one.

00:26:08.160 --> 00:26:09.519
The buyer's named Mu Qing.

00:26:10.759 --> 00:26:12.720
But they're demanding that

00:26:13.000 --> 00:26:14.799
only one of us can go tomorrow.

00:26:15.319 --> 00:26:17.240
And it has to be a cash-for-goods deal.

00:26:17.799 --> 00:26:18.880
I'll go in person tomorrow.

00:26:19.519 --> 00:26:20.640
All right, got it.

00:26:27.160 --> 00:26:27.960
Got it, got it, got it.

00:26:28.640 --> 00:26:29.319
Understood.

00:26:36.079 --> 00:26:36.960
Brother Qiang agreed.

00:26:38.000 --> 00:26:39.079
He said he'll go alone.

00:26:44.000 --> 00:26:44.920
He's a sensible man.

00:26:48.880 --> 00:26:49.880
Let me see you out, then.

00:27:25.119 --> 00:27:25.960
You're already so chubby,

00:27:26.079 --> 00:27:26.880
and you still won't lose weight?

00:27:27.039 --> 00:27:27.640
All you think about is food.

00:27:27.640 --> 00:27:28.720
You know nothing.

00:27:29.480 --> 00:27:30.880
When it comes to food...

00:27:30.880 --> 00:27:32.759
Young girls all like this kind of bag, right?

00:27:34.240 --> 00:27:35.920
Captain Lu, Li Qiang is with Tian Xin.

00:27:35.920 --> 00:27:36.359
What?

00:27:37.799 --> 00:27:39.079
Track Tian Xin's phone immediately.

00:27:39.240 --> 00:27:40.400
Okay, we're heading over right away.

00:27:41.400 --> 00:27:41.880
What's wrong?

00:27:42.920 --> 00:27:44.039
Li Qiang took Tian Xin hostage.

00:27:46.640 --> 00:27:47.119
He Bo,

00:27:47.920 --> 00:27:49.160
go upstairs and tell Zhuang Yan

00:27:49.400 --> 00:27:50.200
not to leave yet.

00:27:50.359 --> 00:27:51.680
You two stand by at the station.

00:27:52.119 --> 00:27:52.400
Yes, sir.

00:27:54.000 --> 00:27:56.079
Tao'er, track Tian Xin's phone right now.

00:27:56.119 --> 00:27:56.400
Got it.

00:27:56.799 --> 00:27:58.160
The rest of us will head to Tian Xin's place.

00:27:58.160 --> 00:27:58.519
Let's move.

00:28:06.039 --> 00:28:06.640
Captain Lu,

00:28:07.440 --> 00:28:09.000
we just tracked Tian Xin's phone.

00:28:12.359 --> 00:28:13.480
She's on Baihua Road right now.

00:28:15.039 --> 00:28:17.839
But she's moving

00:28:18.359 --> 00:28:19.359
in the direction of her home.

00:28:22.720 --> 00:28:24.359
Got it, we're heading there now.

00:28:25.559 --> 00:28:26.119
Understood.

00:28:39.279 --> 00:28:39.960
Ms. Tian,

00:28:42.480 --> 00:28:43.240
I'm sorry.

00:28:44.240 --> 00:28:46.480
I feel like I've talked quite a lot tonight.

00:28:50.160 --> 00:28:52.480
The truth is, I just wanted to be your friend.

00:28:54.960 --> 00:28:56.559
I wonder if I'll have that chance.

00:29:01.240 --> 00:29:01.680
Sure.

00:29:02.880 --> 00:29:04.240
Since we're friends now,

00:29:05.599 --> 00:29:07.599
aren't you going to ask what my name is?

00:29:11.680 --> 00:29:12.440
What's your name?

00:29:13.680 --> 00:29:14.559
I'm Li Qiang.

00:29:15.599 --> 00:29:17.160
If we get the chance to meet again,

00:29:17.559 --> 00:29:19.319
I can tell you my story.

00:29:22.960 --> 00:29:24.400
I'm sure you'll find it interesting.

00:29:26.920 --> 00:29:29.960
But for now, it's time to say good night.

00:29:51.200 --> 00:29:51.920
Are you okay?

00:29:55.279 --> 00:29:58.240
Why are you only showing up now?

00:30:00.839 --> 00:30:02.680
I sent you so many messages.

00:30:02.680 --> 00:30:04.319
Why didn't you reply?

00:30:04.319 --> 00:30:06.000
Why didn't you answer my calls?

00:30:06.799 --> 00:30:07.960
You promised me.

00:30:08.160 --> 00:30:09.920
Whenever I needed you,

00:30:09.920 --> 00:30:11.799
you'd be by my side.

00:30:12.279 --> 00:30:13.160
Where were you?

00:30:13.160 --> 00:30:15.359
Why didn't you care about me?

00:30:16.920 --> 00:30:17.519
I'm sorry.

00:30:19.119 --> 00:30:20.319
I was on a mission.

00:30:23.400 --> 00:30:24.119
Right.

00:30:24.839 --> 00:30:26.480
You were on a mission.

00:30:27.039 --> 00:30:28.279
Tonight, you protected

00:30:28.279 --> 00:30:29.880
everyone in this city.

00:30:30.599 --> 00:30:31.920
Then what about me?

00:30:32.880 --> 00:30:33.920
What about me?

00:30:39.640 --> 00:30:40.240
I'm sorry.

00:30:42.319 --> 00:30:44.480
In your world, am I

00:30:45.720 --> 00:30:47.559
completely dispensable?

00:30:48.240 --> 00:30:50.920
No, you're so important to me.

00:30:51.200 --> 00:30:51.920
Important?

00:30:53.559 --> 00:30:56.319
You have no clue what I really want.

00:30:58.599 --> 00:31:00.400
Yes, I like you.

00:31:00.920 --> 00:31:02.480
I love you.

00:31:03.759 --> 00:31:05.759
But I'm just an ordinary person.

00:31:06.000 --> 00:31:07.839
I'm not that noble.

00:31:08.799 --> 00:31:09.559
What I want...

00:31:09.920 --> 00:31:11.279
I don't want to live every day

00:31:11.279 --> 00:31:13.920
terrified and worried sick for you.

00:31:13.960 --> 00:31:14.680
I won't.

00:31:14.680 --> 00:31:16.200
I just can't do it.

00:31:16.680 --> 00:31:18.400
I just want you by my side.

00:31:18.480 --> 00:31:19.440
Do you understand?

00:31:20.000 --> 00:31:20.599
I understand.

00:31:21.599 --> 00:31:22.119
I swear.

00:31:22.680 --> 00:31:23.720
After today,

00:31:23.720 --> 00:31:24.960
this will never happen again.

00:31:25.440 --> 00:31:27.559
From now on, no matter what,

00:31:27.559 --> 00:31:29.119
I'll always put you first.

00:31:29.680 --> 00:31:30.240
Okay?

00:31:36.440 --> 00:31:37.720
Can you really do that?

00:32:16.559 --> 00:32:17.599
Let's break up.

00:32:40.839 --> 00:32:41.400
Head upstairs.

00:32:41.720 --> 00:32:43.200
Find a way to get a statement from Tian Xin.

00:32:44.359 --> 00:32:45.279
We need to find out

00:32:45.640 --> 00:32:47.319
what Li Qiang said to her tonight.

00:32:48.119 --> 00:32:48.519
Also,

00:32:49.640 --> 00:32:51.720
confirm whether our wiretap on Xu Duoduo

00:32:51.720 --> 00:32:52.279
has been compromised.

00:32:52.839 --> 00:32:53.240
Understood.

00:32:53.839 --> 00:32:55.039
If Tian Xin is willing,

00:32:55.480 --> 00:32:56.240
starting tomorrow,

00:32:56.839 --> 00:32:58.920
find her another place to stay.

00:33:00.240 --> 00:33:00.599
Will do.

00:33:10.920 --> 00:33:13.359
Let's assign someone else to monitor Xu Duoduo.

00:33:13.519 --> 00:33:16.000
Li Xiao's in no condition for it right now either.

00:33:50.839 --> 00:33:52.200
Sule Apartments is Yangon's

00:33:52.200 --> 00:33:54.200
newest central landmark.

00:33:54.400 --> 00:33:55.599
The high-floor units boast

00:33:55.599 --> 00:33:57.680
a 360-degree panoramic view.

00:33:57.839 --> 00:33:59.880
The area features a large community,

00:33:59.880 --> 00:34:02.920
shopping malls, luxury hotels,

00:34:02.920 --> 00:34:04.880
and international schools.

00:34:04.960 --> 00:34:07.359
It's right by the urban expressway,

00:34:07.359 --> 00:34:09.880
highways, and airport transit links,

00:34:10.039 --> 00:34:13.519
perfect for living and visiting.

00:34:15.079 --> 00:34:16.519
In Country M, this building

00:34:16.679 --> 00:34:17.679
is considered premier luxury living.

00:34:18.000 --> 00:34:19.559
It's ideal for Mr. and Mrs. Ma

00:34:19.559 --> 00:34:21.400
to stay while doing business here.

00:34:21.840 --> 00:34:23.679
My boss asked me to tell you, Mr. Ma,

00:34:24.039 --> 00:34:25.800
that this apartment or the hotel next door...

00:34:26.079 --> 00:34:27.199
If you like either,

00:34:27.519 --> 00:34:30.159
we can make it available indefinitely

00:34:30.480 --> 00:34:31.320
for you and your wife.

00:34:33.000 --> 00:34:35.280
Please thank Mr. Theerade for me.

00:34:35.920 --> 00:34:38.079
Our boss also asked me to let you know

00:34:38.079 --> 00:34:39.719
that everything has been arranged for you.

00:34:40.320 --> 00:34:41.800
Tomorrow, please head to Cyrano

00:34:41.840 --> 00:34:44.400
to meet his partner in person.

00:34:44.760 --> 00:34:45.639
Please tell him

00:34:45.920 --> 00:34:48.639
I'll handle everything properly.

00:34:50.440 --> 00:34:51.119
Much obliged, Mr. Ma.

00:34:59.920 --> 00:35:03.599
We really seemed at a dead end,

00:35:04.199 --> 00:35:06.039
yet found a way through!

00:35:07.079 --> 00:35:08.639
What an auspicious start!

00:35:09.239 --> 00:35:10.400
In recent years, Theerade

00:35:10.559 --> 00:35:12.559
has been busy going legitimate.

00:35:12.639 --> 00:35:13.960
The rest of the gang's affairs

00:35:14.360 --> 00:35:15.719
were handed over to his partner,

00:35:16.079 --> 00:35:17.079
a man named Jiang Liye.

00:35:17.920 --> 00:35:20.079
The meeting he set up for you at Cyrano

00:35:20.159 --> 00:35:22.079
is likely with this very man.

00:35:22.840 --> 00:35:24.639
If your negotiations succeed,

00:35:25.360 --> 00:35:26.199
I believe, Mr. Ma,

00:35:26.679 --> 00:35:28.280
you'll secure a direct supply.

00:35:30.679 --> 00:35:32.840
Between Theerade and The Big Four Families,

00:35:32.960 --> 00:35:34.639
things look calm on the surface,

00:35:34.840 --> 00:35:36.760
but conflict could erupt at any second.

00:35:37.239 --> 00:35:38.519
That's why right now,

00:35:38.719 --> 00:35:41.440
he desperately needs your help, Mr. Ma,

00:35:41.480 --> 00:35:43.760
to cement his power and standing.

00:35:44.960 --> 00:35:46.639
If Mr. Theerade is so rich,

00:35:47.440 --> 00:35:49.239
why not just go completely clean?

00:35:49.400 --> 00:35:51.159
Why still deal in this shady business?

00:35:53.280 --> 00:35:54.079
When it comes to money,

00:35:54.159 --> 00:35:55.920
nothing is strictly black and white.

00:35:57.280 --> 00:35:58.440
If Theerade

00:35:59.039 --> 00:36:00.880
severed all ties with the mob,

00:36:01.519 --> 00:36:03.480
The Big Four Families would've wiped him out.

00:36:03.880 --> 00:36:05.480
In this game, you're never truly free.

00:36:05.639 --> 00:36:07.519
In every corner of the world,

00:36:07.920 --> 00:36:08.639
it's the exact same story.

00:36:11.000 --> 00:36:11.679
Lao Qin,

00:36:12.760 --> 00:36:17.239
without your mediation and outreach,

00:36:17.840 --> 00:36:19.800
I wouldn't have even been able

00:36:19.800 --> 00:36:20.480
to meet Mr. Theerade.

00:36:22.239 --> 00:36:23.559
I have an idea.

00:36:23.679 --> 00:36:24.039
Go ahead.

00:36:24.719 --> 00:36:25.280
Lao Qin,

00:36:26.400 --> 00:36:29.400
you know the local scene inside out,

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:33.000
and I have distribution channels back home.

00:36:33.920 --> 00:36:35.519
We could team up

00:36:36.239 --> 00:36:38.280
and set our sights across Southeast Asia.

00:36:38.639 --> 00:36:39.920
A powerhouse alliance

00:36:40.119 --> 00:36:41.360
to build something truly big.

00:36:42.719 --> 00:36:43.199
Well, if you put it that way...

00:36:43.199 --> 00:36:43.679
Boss.

00:36:44.679 --> 00:36:45.280
It's Brother Qiang on the line.

00:36:46.559 --> 00:36:46.920
Excuse me.

00:36:47.320 --> 00:36:47.719
Please.

00:36:57.079 --> 00:36:58.920
Got it, boss. Understood.

00:37:01.119 --> 00:37:03.000
Brother Qiang, what did the boss say?

00:37:04.079 --> 00:37:05.480
Forget about Chen Hai for now.

00:37:06.119 --> 00:37:07.679
How we operate in Nanhai from now on

00:37:08.400 --> 00:37:09.480
will be entirely up to us.

00:37:11.199 --> 00:37:12.800
But what about Mr. Chen?

00:37:13.760 --> 00:37:15.480
Since the boss said so,

00:37:15.719 --> 00:37:17.159
he must have found

00:37:17.159 --> 00:37:18.480
a bigger dealer in Country M.

00:37:19.159 --> 00:37:20.239
Never mind Chen Hai,

00:37:20.480 --> 00:37:21.840
even the Piyazi brothers

00:37:22.519 --> 00:37:24.000
won't necessarily outdo us in the future.

00:37:25.199 --> 00:37:26.480
Once we push a few more shipments for them,

00:37:27.079 --> 00:37:28.639
we can set up our own turf.

00:37:29.719 --> 00:37:31.880
Then Nanhai will belong to you, Brother Qiang.

00:37:37.760 --> 00:37:38.280
Brother Qiang.

00:37:38.480 --> 00:37:40.039
Sister Mu Qing asked me to give you this.

00:37:40.159 --> 00:37:42.000
I fully charged the phone inside for you.

00:37:46.280 --> 00:37:46.639
Let's go.

00:37:48.440 --> 00:37:49.000
What are you doing?

00:37:49.360 --> 00:37:49.960
Going home!

00:37:50.239 --> 00:37:50.880
Go that way.

00:37:55.119 --> 00:37:56.679
Who the hell do you think you are?

00:37:57.320 --> 00:37:58.079
Drop the attitude!

00:37:58.079 --> 00:37:58.519
That's enough, Duoduo.

00:37:58.519 --> 00:38:00.480
Would you get a cut without my hookup?

00:38:00.480 --> 00:38:01.000
Forget it, just let it go.

00:38:01.000 --> 00:38:01.480
Get back here. Come here!

00:38:01.559 --> 00:38:02.559
You think I won't kill you?

00:38:09.880 --> 00:38:10.960
There's more for you once it's done.

00:38:11.559 --> 00:38:12.440
Work harder from now on.

00:38:12.599 --> 00:38:13.719
Stop wasting time playing games.

00:38:14.400 --> 00:38:15.239
Listen to Brother Qiang from now on.

00:38:21.159 --> 00:38:22.800
Li Qiang and his men have left.

00:38:23.239 --> 00:38:24.800
Not sure if they're carrying drugs.

00:38:25.000 --> 00:38:27.119
Xu Duoduo and Li Yawei are still in range.

00:38:27.119 --> 00:38:28.159
Don't spook them.

00:38:28.320 --> 00:38:29.039
Let Li Qiang go.

00:38:29.679 --> 00:38:30.400
Copy that, Captain Bai.

00:38:31.440 --> 00:38:33.880
Keep monitoring Xu Duoduo and Li Yawei.

00:38:34.000 --> 00:38:34.800
Understood.

00:38:37.360 --> 00:38:37.880
Let Li Qiang go?

00:38:43.159 --> 00:38:44.239
Should we send someone to tail him?

00:38:44.360 --> 00:38:44.719
No need.

00:38:47.519 --> 00:38:49.559
Chasing the fish won't catch it.

00:38:51.400 --> 00:38:53.639
The fish has to swim into the net on its own.

00:38:55.079 --> 00:38:56.079
Just like Mu Qing.

00:38:57.960 --> 00:38:59.079
The reason she put the deal

00:38:59.079 --> 00:39:01.159
at the press conference

00:39:01.760 --> 00:39:02.880
is that it puts Li Qiang

00:39:03.480 --> 00:39:04.639
in harm's way,

00:39:05.320 --> 00:39:06.119
while she herself

00:39:06.559 --> 00:39:07.920
stays in a safe zone.

00:39:08.280 --> 00:39:10.320
If anything goes wrong with the deal,

00:39:11.559 --> 00:39:13.599
she can pull the plug anytime.

00:39:20.159 --> 00:39:22.079
This William Han, along with Mu Qing,

00:39:22.719 --> 00:39:24.239
checked into Gangdu Hotel yesterday.

00:39:25.400 --> 00:39:26.679
After they checked in,

00:39:27.199 --> 00:39:29.320
I sent officers to stake out the hotel.

00:39:30.920 --> 00:39:33.159
From the start of our operation today

00:39:33.599 --> 00:39:35.760
until everyone left the hotel,

00:39:36.320 --> 00:39:37.440
vehicles from our CID unit

00:39:37.440 --> 00:39:38.519
have been tailing them covertly

00:39:39.559 --> 00:39:42.039
to prevent dealers from changing locations.

00:39:43.639 --> 00:39:44.280
In addition,

00:39:45.159 --> 00:39:47.199
our temporary command post on-site

00:39:47.199 --> 00:39:48.360
has been set up on the ninth floor,

00:39:50.360 --> 00:39:51.639
while the press conference

00:39:51.840 --> 00:39:54.599
is in a first-floor meeting room.

00:39:55.320 --> 00:39:56.679
Right now, our CID officers

00:39:57.239 --> 00:39:58.360
are undercover as book fans,

00:39:58.559 --> 00:40:00.039
waiting in the hotel lobby.

00:40:03.000 --> 00:40:05.960
Mu Qing and Li Qiang are both very crafty.

00:40:06.079 --> 00:40:07.599
The key to this operation

00:40:08.760 --> 00:40:10.239
is the press conference venue.

00:40:12.199 --> 00:40:16.119
Li Qiang left right after seeing Xu Duoduo.

00:40:17.119 --> 00:40:17.880
I'm guessing

00:40:19.039 --> 00:40:21.199
he got a pass to the press conference.

00:40:28.719 --> 00:40:30.960
For William Han's press conference,

00:40:31.719 --> 00:40:34.119
a total of 23 media outlets were invited.

00:40:35.119 --> 00:40:36.639
And a week ago,

00:40:37.199 --> 00:40:40.360
these attending organizations and media

00:40:41.039 --> 00:40:43.519
already received invitations and passes.

00:40:45.679 --> 00:40:46.760
Weisheng Hotel

00:40:47.519 --> 00:40:49.320
has set the security level

00:40:49.840 --> 00:40:51.559
for this press conference extremely high.

00:40:52.119 --> 00:40:53.480
Without an access pass,

00:40:54.280 --> 00:40:56.199
no one can enter the venue.

00:41:00.079 --> 00:41:02.320
Last night, we contacted

00:41:02.320 --> 00:41:03.599
the editor-in-chief of Nanhai Times.

00:41:03.800 --> 00:41:04.880
Two hours ago,

00:41:05.760 --> 00:41:07.519
they sent over two access passes.

00:41:08.280 --> 00:41:09.599
I'm sending Zhuang Yan and Ge Dan.

00:41:09.960 --> 00:41:11.199
They're both fresh faces,

00:41:11.480 --> 00:41:12.320
which makes the mission easier.

00:41:14.719 --> 00:41:15.159
Good.

00:41:25.920 --> 00:41:26.280
Captain Bai.

00:41:26.880 --> 00:41:27.400
How are things?

00:41:28.239 --> 00:41:28.800
Everything okay?

00:41:30.360 --> 00:41:31.599
I should be able to finish the mission.

00:41:31.639 --> 00:41:33.000
You don't sound very confident.

00:41:34.159 --> 00:41:35.440
Qian Feng has slipped away twice already.

00:41:36.199 --> 00:41:37.920
Unforeseen bumps during ops are inevitable.

00:41:38.599 --> 00:41:41.159
Drug traffickers aren't like ordinary criminals.

00:41:41.480 --> 00:41:42.320
Not only are they ruthless,

00:41:42.679 --> 00:41:43.840
they're also extremely cunning.

00:41:45.400 --> 00:41:46.920
Experience in narcotics...

00:41:47.039 --> 00:41:49.199
Even old hands like Captain Lu and me

00:41:49.360 --> 00:41:50.360
have to keep building it up.

00:41:50.960 --> 00:41:52.000
So don't get discouraged.

00:41:52.800 --> 00:41:53.400
What matters most

00:41:53.840 --> 00:41:55.159
is keeping yourself safe.

00:41:55.519 --> 00:41:56.320
That's also the main reason

00:41:56.320 --> 00:41:58.119
I didn't want you acting recklessly before.

00:41:58.800 --> 00:41:59.480
Understood, Captain.

00:42:00.000 --> 00:42:00.480
Hang in there.

00:42:03.039 --> 00:42:03.440
Captain?

00:42:04.199 --> 00:42:05.320
Can I ask you something?

00:42:06.079 --> 00:42:06.519
Go ahead.

00:42:07.400 --> 00:42:09.239
Back when Captain Lu and I went to Hongzhuang Garden,

00:42:09.239 --> 00:42:10.840
I made a mistake on that mission.

00:42:11.519 --> 00:42:12.559
Why didn't you reprimand me?

00:42:14.119 --> 00:42:14.880
About the gas leak incident?

00:42:15.079 --> 00:42:15.480
Yeah.

00:42:16.480 --> 00:42:17.639
The whole station knows

00:42:17.639 --> 00:42:19.320
I'm extremely arrogant

00:42:19.480 --> 00:42:20.760
and overconfident.

00:42:20.960 --> 00:42:21.760
After screwing up like that,

00:42:21.760 --> 00:42:22.639
I couldn't even forgive myself.

00:42:23.199 --> 00:42:24.519
So why didn't our notoriously strict captain

00:42:25.440 --> 00:42:26.239
scold me?

00:42:27.400 --> 00:42:28.199
Strict?

00:42:30.039 --> 00:42:32.760
Is that really how you all see me?

00:42:33.920 --> 00:42:35.079
Nice weather today, isn't it?

00:42:36.400 --> 00:42:36.880
No, wait...

00:42:42.000 --> 00:42:42.679
Well, now I know.

00:42:44.280 --> 00:42:45.440
Maybe...

00:42:46.559 --> 00:42:48.360
everyone has their strengths and weaknesses.

00:42:49.239 --> 00:42:50.000
Holding yourself to high standards

00:42:50.000 --> 00:42:51.360
isn't necessarily a bad thing.

00:42:51.639 --> 00:42:52.800
Just don't put too much pressure on yourself.

00:42:54.440 --> 00:42:55.119
Anyway...

00:42:55.920 --> 00:42:56.639
I believe in you.

00:42:57.880 --> 00:42:58.480
Thank you, Captain.

00:42:59.199 --> 00:42:59.679
Let's go.

00:43:01.360 --> 00:43:02.159
Strict, huh?

00:43:06.199 --> 00:43:06.639
Where are you heading?

00:43:07.119 --> 00:43:07.760
Going home.

00:43:08.239 --> 00:43:09.119
Everyone is swamped,

00:43:09.119 --> 00:43:09.920
and you're heading home alone?

00:43:10.239 --> 00:43:11.239
Captain Lu gave me special permission.

00:43:12.119 --> 00:43:12.920
Tian Xin

00:43:13.480 --> 00:43:15.400
refused to cooperate with our team.

00:43:15.559 --> 00:43:16.320
Right now,

00:43:17.800 --> 00:43:20.719
Guan Qiang and Xiao He are running the wiretap.

00:43:21.360 --> 00:43:22.079
What about you?

00:43:22.559 --> 00:43:23.280
Personal reasons.

00:43:24.119 --> 00:43:24.960
For now,

00:43:26.679 --> 00:43:28.119
I can't take part in our operation.